  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 2／Walters・品種] act as a self-seeding annual / [stauden.de・cultivar] oft Selbstaussaat（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／Walters・品種] Even in cold regions this will act as a self-seeding annual and bloom all season long.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] Gaißmayer は 2 相当、stauden.de は 2 相当\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] こぼれ種：言い回しの照合では 1、文を読み直して 2（[Walters・品種] act as a self-seeding annual / [stauden.de・cultivar] oft Selbstaussaat）\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
